silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_13_regression_test_suite_sections_03_probe_domesticcat_collapse_concrete_anchor_2#taxrowtsn183798 silm:hasLongDescription "The TaxRowTSN183798 is The taxonomy-source node; source of iota_tsn into Mittens; a database row, not a type predicate. On the opposite side of Mittens from DomesticCat in the cocone diagram. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'TaxRow_{TSN 183798}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
